<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-SWEDE ENQVIST WINS MARSEILLE OPEN TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDE ENQVIST WINS MARSEILLE OPEN TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>MARSEILLE, France 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in</p>
<p>the $539,250 Marseille Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-4 1-0</p>
<p>(Rios withdrew injured).</p>
</text>
